{"id":"classic-web2","title":"Classic Web 2.0 — 2005 Portal","description":"The classic post-Y2K \"Web 2.0\" portal — blue gradient header, nav tabs, sidebar widgets, glossy aqua buttons, a working poll, rounded boxes and a BETA sticker. Pure 2005 nostalgia.","tags":["classic","web2","portal"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:34:00.196Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Classic Web 2.0 — 2005 Portal\ndescription: The classic post-Y2K \"Web 2.0\" portal — blue gradient header, nav tabs, sidebar widgets, glossy aqua buttons, a working poll, rounded boxes and a BETA sticker. Pure 2005 nostalgia.\ntags: [classic, web2, portal]\norder: 11\n---\n\n# Classic Web 2.0 — 2005 Portal\n\nThe era between Y2K chaos and flat modernism: fixed-width centered layout, blue gradient\nheader with tab navigation, rounded sidebar widgets, glossy \"aqua\" buttons, RSS badges\nand a starburst BETA sticker.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Page background | `#d9dde3` grey-blue |\n| Content panel | `#ffffff`, border `#b5bdc9`, soft shadow |\n| Header / nav | gradient `#5b93d5 → #2f5f9e`, white tabs |\n| Links | `#1a5299`, underline on hover |\n| Sidebar boxes | `#eef3fa` on `#dce8f5` borders, 8px radius |\n| Buttons | aqua gloss — `#7db2e8 → #366cae` with top highlight |\n| Type | Arial / Tahoma 12–13px, Verdana small print |\n\n## Pieces\n\nGradient header + tab nav → breadcrumb → sidebar (search, categories, **working poll**\nwith animated result bars, sponsors boxes) → article post with comments (add one!) →\nfooter with XHTML/RSS badges. Starburst \"BETA!\" sticker sits on the header corner.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Classic Web 2.0 — 2005 Portal\n\nThe era between Y2K chaos and flat modernism: fixed-width centered layout, blue gradient\nheader with tab navigation, rounded sidebar widgets, glossy \"aqua\" buttons, RSS badges\nand a starburst BETA sticker.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Page background | `#d9dde3` grey-blue |\n| Content panel | `#ffffff`, border `#b5bdc9`, soft shadow |\n| Header / nav | gradient `#5b93d5 → #2f5f9e`, white tabs |\n| Links | `#1a5299`, underline on hover |\n| Sidebar boxes | `#eef3fa` on `#dce8f5` borders, 8px radius |\n| Buttons | aqua gloss — `#7db2e8 → #366cae` with top highlight |\n| Type | Arial / Tahoma 12–13px, Verdana small print |\n\n## Pieces\n\nGradient header + tab nav → breadcrumb → sidebar (search, categories, **working poll**\nwith animated result bars, sponsors boxes) → article post with comments (add one!) →\nfooter with XHTML/RSS badges. Starburst \"BETA!\" sticker sits on the header corner.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>PixelPortal — Your Source For Everything Cool :: Home\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { background: #d9dde3; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12.5px; color: #333; padding: 18px 10px 40px; }\n  a { color: #1a5299; }\n  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n  .page { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #b5bdc9; box-shadow: 0 3px 14px rgba(40, 60, 90, 0.25); position: relative; }\n\n  /* header + tabs */\n  .header { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #6ba3e0, #2f5f9e 70%, #2a548c); padding: 22px 26px 16px; color: #fff; position: relative; }\n  .logo { font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-shadow: 0 2px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); }\n  .logo span { color: #cfe2f8; font-weight: normal; }\n  .tagline { font-style: italic; font-size: 11.5px; color: #d7e6fa; margin-top: 2px; }\n  .beta { position: absolute; top: -14px; right: -16px; width: 84px; height: 84px; background: #ffd400; color: #b34000; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; display: grid; place-items: center; transform: rotate(12deg); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 61% 12%, 75% 6%, 80% 21%, 95% 21%, 92% 36%, 105% 44%, 93% 54%, 100% 67%, 85% 71%, 85% 86%, 70% 83%, 63% 97%, 50% 87%, 37% 97%, 30% 83%, 15% 86%, 15% 71%, 0% 67%, 7% 54%, -5% 44%, 8% 36%, 5% 21%, 20% 21%, 25% 6%, 39% 12%); box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; }\n  .tabs { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #33619c, #2a548c); padding: 0 26px; display: flex; gap: 3px; }\n  .tabs a { color: #cfe0f5; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 16px; border: 1px solid #24487a; border-bottom: 0; border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #4879b8, #35619c); }\n  .tabs a:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #5c8cc9, #4272ae); }\n  .tabs a.active { background: #fff; color: #2f5f9e; border-color: #b5bdc9; padding-bottom: 9px; margin-bottom: -1px; }\n\n  .breadcrumb { padding: 8px 26px; font-size: 11px; color: #888; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e8ee; }\n  .breadcrumb b { color: #444; }\n\n  .cols { display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 18px 26px 26px; }\n  .main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }\n  .side { width: 220px; flex: none; }\n\n  /* sidebar widgets */\n  .box { border: 1px solid #b9cce4; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; }\n  .box h3 { font-size: 11.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #6ba3e0, #3a6cae); padding: 6px 12px; text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n  .box .in { padding: 10px 12px; background: #eef3fa; }\n  .side ul { list-style: none; }\n  .side ul li { padding: 4px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #c4d4e8; font-size: 12px; }\n  .side ul li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n  .side ul li a { text-decoration: none; }\n  .side ul li a::before { content: \"» \"; color: #7ba2d4; }\n  .side ul li .cnt { color: #999; font-size: 10.5px; }\n  .search { display: flex; gap: 4px; }\n  .search input { flex: 1; border: 1px solid #a9bdd6; padding: 4px 6px; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; }\n  .glossy { display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #2a548c; border-radius: 12px; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11.5px; padding: 5px 14px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #9cc4ef, #5b93d5 48%, #366cae 52%, #4a7ebb); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); }\n  .glossy:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #b3d3f5, #6ba3e0 48%, #4272ae 52%, #5588c5); }\n  .glossy:active { box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n\n  /* poll */\n  .poll label { display: block; padding: 3px 0; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; }\n  .poll .bar-wrap { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #b9cce4; border-radius: 4px; height: 14px; margin: 3px 0 6px; overflow: hidden; }\n  .poll .bar { height: 100%; width: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8fbcec, #366cae); transition: width 0.9s ease; }\n  .poll .pct { font-weight: bold; color: #2f5f9e; }\n\n  /* ads */\n  .ads { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }\n  .ad { border: 1px dashed #b0bfd4; height: 92px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 10.5px; color: #98a7bd; background: #f4f7fb; }\n\n  /* article */\n  .post h1 { font-size: 20px; color: #2f5f9e; letter-spacing: -0.3px; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .meta { font-size: 10.5px; color: #999; padding: 5px 0 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e8ee; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .meta b { color: #555; }\n  .post p { line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 12.5px; }\n  .post img { float: left; margin: 3px 12px 8px 0; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 3px; background: #fff; }\n  .ph { width: 190px; height: 130px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9cc4ef, #2f5f9e); display: inline-grid; place-items: center; color: #fff; font-size: 34px; }\n  .share { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 0; border-top: 1px dotted #ccc; font-size: 11px; color: #888; }\n\n  /* comments */\n  .comments { margin-top: 20px; }\n  .comments h2 { font-size: 14px; color: #2f5f9e; border-bottom: 2px solid #dfe6ef; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .comment { display: flex; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #d5dce6; }\n  .ava { width: 36px; height: 36px; flex: none; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c4d4e8, #7ba2d4); border: 1px solid #b5bdc9; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 16px; color: #fff; }\n  .comment .who { font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px; }\n  .comment .who span { color: #999; font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5px; }\n  .comment p { margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .cform { background: #eef3fa; border: 1px solid #d5dce6; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; margin-top: 14px; }\n  .cform input, .cform textarea { width: 100%; border: 1px solid #a9bdd6; padding: 5px 7px; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .cform textarea { height: 54px; resize: vertical; }\n\n  footer { border-top: 1px solid #b5bdc9; background: #eef1f5; padding: 14px 26px; font-size: 10.5px; color: #8894a5; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }\n  footer .links a { margin-right: 10px; }\n  .badge { display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #999; background: #fff; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: bold; color: #666; margin-left: 4px; }\n  .badge.rss { color: #fff; background: #f60; border-color: #c50; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 760px) { .cols { flex-direction: column; } .side { width: 100%; } .beta { right: 4px; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"page\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"header\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"beta\">WEB\u003cbr>2.0\u003cbr>BETA!\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"logo\">Pixel\u003cspan>Portal\u003c/span>.com\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tagline\">Your #1 source for everything cool on the interwebs — since 2005!\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"tabs\">\n      \u003ca class=\"active\" href=\"#\">Home\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Articles\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Downloads\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Gallery\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Forum\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">About Us\u003c/a>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"breadcrumb\">You are here: \u003ca href=\"#\">Home\u003c/a> » \u003ca href=\"#\">Articles\u003c/a> » \u003cb>Web design is dead (again)\u003c/b>\u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"cols\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"main\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"post\">\n          \u003ch1>Web design is dead (again). We disagree.\u003c/h1>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"meta\">Posted \u003cb>12 Oct 2006\u003c/b> by \u003cb>admin\u003c/b> · Category: \u003ca href=\"#\">Web Design\u003c/a> · \u003ca href=\"#\">32 comments\u003c/a> · \u003ca href=\"#\">Permalink\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n          \u003cp>\u003cspan class=\"ph\">🖥️\u003c/span>Every few months somebody declares web design finished. First tables were going to kill it, then Flash, then \"the industry\" moved on to gradients, rounded corners and reflections on everything.\u003c/p>\n          \u003cp>Here at PixelPortal we say: good design never dies, it just changes its hairstyle. Remember when a drop shadow had to be a sliced GIF? When rounded corners were four images and a prayer? We do — and honestly, we kind of miss the craftsmanship.\u003c/p>\n          \u003cp>This week we look back at five techniques from the golden era that still hold up: the humble breadcrumb, the trusty left sidebar, the gloss button you can almost feel, the 1px bevel, and the word \"community\" used without irony.\u003c/p>\n          \u003cp>Agree? Disagree? The comment box is right below, the guestbook is still warm, and the forum is open 24 hours. The interwebs is what we make it, folks. — \u003ci>The Editor\u003c/i>\u003c/p>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"share\">❤ Like (128) · ✉ Tell a friend · 🔖 Bookmark this page (Ctrl+D) · \u003ca href=\"#\">Print this article\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"comments\">\n          \u003ch2>32 Comments\u003c/h2>\n          \u003cdiv id=\"clist\">\n            \u003cdiv class=\"comment\">\u003cdiv class=\"ava\">😎\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"who\">webmaster_2006 \u003cspan>· 12 Oct 2006, 3:42 PM\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cp>First!!!1 Great article admin. The gloss buttons section is so true, my whole site is gloss buttons lol.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv class=\"comment\">\u003cdiv class=\"ava\">🐱\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"who\">xX_nurul_Xx \u003cspan>· 12 Oct 2006, 5:17 PM\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cp>Saya suka baca blog ni setiap hari. Keep it up! Greeting from Shah Alam 😊\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"cform\">\n            \u003cb style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5f9e\">Leave a comment:\u003c/b>\u003cbr>\u003cbr>\n            \u003cinput id=\"cname\" placeholder=\"Your name (or be Anonymous 2006)\">\n            \u003ctextarea id=\"ctext\" placeholder=\"Say something nice…\">\u003c/textarea>\n            \u003cbutton class=\"glossy\" id=\"cpost\">Post Comment\u003c/button>\n          \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"side\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"box\">\u003ch3>Search\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"in\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"search\">\u003cinput placeholder=\"Google search…\">\u003cbutton class=\"glossy\">Go!\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"box\">\u003ch3>Categories\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"in\">\u003cul>\n          \u003cli>\u003ca href=\"#\">Web Design\u003c/a> \u003cspan class=\"cnt\">(128)\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003ca href=\"#\">Free Templates\u003c/a> \u003cspan class=\"cnt\">(54)\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003ca href=\"#\">Photoshop Tips\u003c/a> \u003cspan class=\"cnt\">(91)\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003ca href=\"#\">Nostalgia\u003c/a> \u003cspan class=\"cnt\">(47)\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003ca href=\"#\">Forum News\u003c/a> \u003cspan class=\"cnt\">(12)\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"box\">\u003ch3>Weekly Poll\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"in poll\" id=\"poll\">\n          \u003cb>Best button style?\u003c/b>\n          \u003cdiv id=\"pollOpts\">\n            \u003clabel>\u003cinput type=\"radio\" name=\"p\" value=\"0\" checked> Glossy aqua\u003c/label>\n            \u003clabel>\u003cinput type=\"radio\" name=\"p\" value=\"1\"> Flat & minimal\u003c/label>\n            \u003clabel>\u003cinput type=\"radio\" name=\"p\" value=\"2\"> Bevelled grey\u003c/label>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"glossy\" id=\"pvote\">Vote!\u003c/button>\n          \u003cdiv id=\"pollRes\" style=\"display:none\">\n            \u003cdiv>Glossy aqua \u003cspan class=\"pct\" id=\"p0\">0%\u003c/span>\u003cdiv class=\"bar-wrap\">\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" id=\"b0\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv>Flat & minimal \u003cspan class=\"pct\" id=\"p1\">0%\u003c/span>\u003cdiv class=\"bar-wrap\">\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" id=\"b1\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv>Bevelled grey \u003cspan class=\"pct\" id=\"p2\">0%\u003c/span>\u003cdiv class=\"bar-wrap\">\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" id=\"b2\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv style=\"color:#999;font-size:10.5px;margin-top:4px\" id=\"ptotal\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"box\">\u003ch3>Sponsors\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"in ads\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"ad\">Your Ad Here\u003cbr>125 × 125\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"ad\">Your Ad Here\u003cbr>125 × 125\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"box\">\u003ch3>Stay Updated\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"in\">\n          \u003ca href=\"#\" class=\"glossy\" style=\"display:block;text-align:center\">📡 Subscribe RSS Feed\u003c/a>\n          \u003cp style=\"font-size:10.5px;color:#8894a5;margin-top:8px;text-align:center\">Get the latest posts in your RSS reader!\u003c/p>\n        \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cfooter>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"links\">\u003ca href=\"#\">Home\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">About\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Contact\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Privacy\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Site Map\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv>© 2006–2007 PixelPortal.com · All rights reserved · \u003cspan class=\"badge\">XHTML 1.0\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"badge\">CSS\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"badge rss\">RSS ▸\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/footer>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // live-ish date in breadcrumb\n    document.querySelector('.breadcrumb').innerHTML = 'Today is \u003cb>' + new Date().toDateString() + '\u003c/b> — You are here: \u003ca href=\"#\">Home\u003c/a> » \u003ca href=\"#\">Articles\u003c/a> » \u003cb>Web design is dead (again)\u003c/b>';\n\n    // poll with animated result bars\n    const votes = [214, 87, 31];\n    document.getElementById('pvote').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const pick = +document.querySelector('input[name=\"p\"]:checked').value;\n      votes[pick]++;\n      const total = votes.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\n      document.getElementById('pollOpts').style.display = 'none';\n      document.getElementById('pvote').style.display = 'none';\n      document.getElementById('pollRes').style.display = 'block';\n      votes.forEach((v, i) => {\n        const pct = Math.round(v / total * 100);\n        document.getElementById('p' + i).textContent = pct + '%';\n        setTimeout(() => document.getElementById('b' + i).style.width = pct + '%', 60 * i + 50);\n      });\n      document.getElementById('ptotal').textContent = 'Total votes: ' + total + ' — thank you for voting!';\n    });\n\n    // comment posting\n    document.getElementById('cpost').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const name = document.getElementById('cname').value.trim() || 'Anonymous 2006';\n      const text = document.getElementById('ctext').value.trim();\n      if (!text) { document.getElementById('ctext').focus(); return; }\n      const div = document.createElement('div');\n      div.className = 'comment';\n      const now = new Date();\n      div.innerHTML = '\u003cdiv class=\"ava\">🙂\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"who\">' + name.replace(/\u003c/g, '&lt;') +\n        ' \u003cspan>· just now\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cp>' + text.replace(/\u003c/g, '&lt;') + '\u003c/p>\u003c/div>';\n      const list = document.getElementById('clist');\n      list.insertBefore(div, list.firstChild);\n      document.getElementById('ctext').value = '';\n      document.getElementById('cname').value = '';\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>PixelPortal — Your Source For Everything Cool :: Home\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { background: #d9dde3; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12.5px; color: #333; padding: 18px 10px 40px; }\n  a { color: #1a5299; }\n  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n  .page { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #b5bdc9; box-shadow: 0 3px 14px rgba(40, 60, 90, 0.25); position: relative; }\n\n  /* header + tabs */\n  .header { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #6ba3e0, #2f5f9e 70%, #2a548c); padding: 22px 26px 16px; color: #fff; position: relative; }\n  .logo { font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-shadow: 0 2px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); }\n  .logo span { color: #cfe2f8; font-weight: normal; }\n  .tagline { font-style: italic; font-size: 11.5px; color: #d7e6fa; margin-top: 2px; }\n  .beta { position: absolute; top: -14px; right: -16px; width: 84px; height: 84px; background: #ffd400; color: #b34000; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; display: grid; place-items: center; transform: rotate(12deg); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 61% 12%, 75% 6%, 80% 21%, 95% 21%, 92% 36%, 105% 44%, 93% 54%, 100% 67%, 85% 71%, 85% 86%, 70% 83%, 63% 97%, 50% 87%, 37% 97%, 30% 83%, 15% 86%, 15% 71%, 0% 67%, 7% 54%, -5% 44%, 8% 36%, 5% 21%, 20% 21%, 25% 6%, 39% 12%); box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; }\n  .tabs { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #33619c, #2a548c); padding: 0 26px; display: flex; gap: 3px; }\n  .tabs a { color: #cfe0f5; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 16px; border: 1px solid #24487a; border-bottom: 0; border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #4879b8, #35619c); }\n  .tabs a:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #5c8cc9, #4272ae); }\n  .tabs a.active { background: #fff; color: #2f5f9e; border-color: #b5bdc9; padding-bottom: 9px; margin-bottom: -1px; }\n\n  .breadcrumb { padding: 8px 26px; font-size: 11px; color: #888; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e8ee; }\n  .breadcrumb b { color: #444; }\n\n  .cols { display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 18px 26px 26px; }\n  .main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }\n  .side { width: 220px; flex: none; }\n\n  /* sidebar widgets */\n  .box { border: 1px solid #b9cce4; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; }\n  .box h3 { font-size: 11.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #6ba3e0, #3a6cae); padding: 6px 12px; text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n  .box .in { padding: 10px 12px; background: #eef3fa; }\n  .side ul { list-style: none; }\n  .side ul li { padding: 4px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #c4d4e8; font-size: 12px; }\n  .side ul li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n  .side ul li a { text-decoration: none; }\n  .side ul li a::before { content: \"» \"; color: #7ba2d4; }\n  .side ul li .cnt { color: #999; font-size: 10.5px; }\n  .search { display: flex; gap: 4px; }\n  .search input { flex: 1; border: 1px solid #a9bdd6; padding: 4px 6px; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; }\n  .glossy { display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #2a548c; border-radius: 12px; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11.5px; padding: 5px 14px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #9cc4ef, #5b93d5 48%, #366cae 52%, #4a7ebb); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); }\n  .glossy:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #b3d3f5, #6ba3e0 48%, #4272ae 52%, #5588c5); }\n  .glossy:active { box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n\n  /* poll */\n  .poll label { display: block; padding: 3px 0; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; }\n  .poll .bar-wrap { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #b9cce4; border-radius: 4px; height: 14px; margin: 3px 0 6px; overflow: hidden; }\n  .poll .bar { height: 100%; width: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8fbcec, #366cae); transition: width 0.9s ease; }\n  .poll .pct { font-weight: bold; color: #2f5f9e; }\n\n  /* ads */\n  .ads { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }\n  .ad { border: 1px dashed #b0bfd4; height: 92px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 10.5px; color: #98a7bd; background: #f4f7fb; }\n\n  /* article */\n  .post h1 { font-size: 20px; color: #2f5f9e; letter-spacing: -0.3px; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .meta { font-size: 10.5px; color: #999; padding: 5px 0 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e8ee; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .meta b { color: #555; }\n  .post p { line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 12.5px; }\n  .post img { float: left; margin: 3px 12px 8px 0; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 3px; background: #fff; }\n  .ph { width: 190px; height: 130px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9cc4ef, #2f5f9e); display: inline-grid; place-items: center; color: #fff; font-size: 34px; }\n  .share { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 0; border-top: 1px dotted #ccc; font-size: 11px; color: #888; }\n\n  /* comments */\n  .comments { margin-top: 20px; }\n  .comments h2 { font-size: 14px; color: #2f5f9e; border-bottom: 2px solid #dfe6ef; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .comment { display: flex; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #d5dce6; }\n  .ava { width: 36px; height: 36px; flex: none; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c4d4e8, #7ba2d4); border: 1px solid #b5bdc9; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 16px; color: #fff; }\n  .comment .who { font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px; }\n  .comment .who span { color: #999; font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5px; }\n  .comment p { margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .cform { background: #eef3fa; border: 1px solid #d5dce6; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; margin-top: 14px; }\n  .cform input, .cform textarea { width: 100%; border: 1px solid #a9bdd6; padding: 5px 7px; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .cform textarea { height: 54px; resize: vertical; }\n\n  footer { border-top: 1px solid #b5bdc9; background: #eef1f5; padding: 14px 26px; font-size: 10.5px; color: #8894a5; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }\n  footer .links a { margin-right: 10px; }\n  .badge { display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #999; background: #fff; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: bold; color: #666; margin-left: 4px; }\n  .badge.rss { color: #fff; background: #f60; border-color: #c50; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 760px) { .cols { flex-direction: column; } .side { width: 100%; } .beta { right: 4px; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"page\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"header\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"beta\">WEB\u003cbr>2.0\u003cbr>BETA!\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"logo\">Pixel\u003cspan>Portal\u003c/span>.com\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tagline\">Your #1 source for everything cool on the interwebs — since 2005!\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"tabs\">\n      \u003ca class=\"active\" href=\"#\">Home\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Articles\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Downloads\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Gallery\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Forum\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">About Us\u003c/a>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"breadcrumb\">You are here: \u003ca href=\"#\">Home\u003c/a> » \u003ca href=\"#\">Articles\u003c/a> » \u003cb>Web design is dead (again)\u003c/b>\u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"cols\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"main\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"post\">\n          \u003ch1>Web design is dead (again). We disagree.\u003c/h1>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"meta\">Posted \u003cb>12 Oct 2006\u003c/b> by \u003cb>admin\u003c/b> · Category: \u003ca href=\"#\">Web Design\u003c/a> · \u003ca href=\"#\">32 comments\u003c/a> · \u003ca href=\"#\">Permalink\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n          \u003cp>\u003cspan class=\"ph\">🖥️\u003c/span>Every few months somebody declares web design finished. First tables were going to kill it, then Flash, then \"the industry\" moved on to gradients, rounded corners and reflections on everything.\u003c/p>\n          \u003cp>Here at PixelPortal we say: good design never dies, it just changes its hairstyle. Remember when a drop shadow had to be a sliced GIF? When rounded corners were four images and a prayer? We do — and honestly, we kind of miss the craftsmanship.\u003c/p>\n          \u003cp>This week we look back at five techniques from the golden era that still hold up: the humble breadcrumb, the trusty left sidebar, the gloss button you can almost feel, the 1px bevel, and the word \"community\" used without irony.\u003c/p>\n          \u003cp>Agree? Disagree? The comment box is right below, the guestbook is still warm, and the forum is open 24 hours. The interwebs is what we make it, folks. — \u003ci>The Editor\u003c/i>\u003c/p>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"share\">❤ Like (128) · ✉ Tell a friend · 🔖 Bookmark this page (Ctrl+D) · \u003ca href=\"#\">Print this article\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"comments\">\n          \u003ch2>32 Comments\u003c/h2>\n          \u003cdiv id=\"clist\">\n            \u003cdiv class=\"comment\">\u003cdiv class=\"ava\">😎\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"who\">webmaster_2006 \u003cspan>· 12 Oct 2006, 3:42 PM\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cp>First!!!1 Great article admin. The gloss buttons section is so true, my whole site is gloss buttons lol.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv class=\"comment\">\u003cdiv class=\"ava\">🐱\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"who\">xX_nurul_Xx \u003cspan>· 12 Oct 2006, 5:17 PM\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cp>Saya suka baca blog ni setiap hari. Keep it up! Greeting from Shah Alam 😊\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"cform\">\n            \u003cb style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2f5f9e\">Leave a comment:\u003c/b>\u003cbr>\u003cbr>\n            \u003cinput id=\"cname\" placeholder=\"Your name (or be Anonymous 2006)\">\n            \u003ctextarea id=\"ctext\" placeholder=\"Say something nice…\">\u003c/textarea>\n            \u003cbutton class=\"glossy\" id=\"cpost\">Post Comment\u003c/button>\n          \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"side\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"box\">\u003ch3>Search\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"in\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"search\">\u003cinput placeholder=\"Google search…\">\u003cbutton class=\"glossy\">Go!\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"box\">\u003ch3>Categories\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"in\">\u003cul>\n          \u003cli>\u003ca href=\"#\">Web Design\u003c/a> \u003cspan class=\"cnt\">(128)\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003ca href=\"#\">Free Templates\u003c/a> \u003cspan class=\"cnt\">(54)\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003ca href=\"#\">Photoshop Tips\u003c/a> \u003cspan class=\"cnt\">(91)\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003ca href=\"#\">Nostalgia\u003c/a> \u003cspan class=\"cnt\">(47)\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003ca href=\"#\">Forum News\u003c/a> \u003cspan class=\"cnt\">(12)\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"box\">\u003ch3>Weekly Poll\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"in poll\" id=\"poll\">\n          \u003cb>Best button style?\u003c/b>\n          \u003cdiv id=\"pollOpts\">\n            \u003clabel>\u003cinput type=\"radio\" name=\"p\" value=\"0\" checked> Glossy aqua\u003c/label>\n            \u003clabel>\u003cinput type=\"radio\" name=\"p\" value=\"1\"> Flat & minimal\u003c/label>\n            \u003clabel>\u003cinput type=\"radio\" name=\"p\" value=\"2\"> Bevelled grey\u003c/label>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"glossy\" id=\"pvote\">Vote!\u003c/button>\n          \u003cdiv id=\"pollRes\" style=\"display:none\">\n            \u003cdiv>Glossy aqua \u003cspan class=\"pct\" id=\"p0\">0%\u003c/span>\u003cdiv class=\"bar-wrap\">\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" id=\"b0\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv>Flat & minimal \u003cspan class=\"pct\" id=\"p1\">0%\u003c/span>\u003cdiv class=\"bar-wrap\">\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" id=\"b1\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv>Bevelled grey \u003cspan class=\"pct\" id=\"p2\">0%\u003c/span>\u003cdiv class=\"bar-wrap\">\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" id=\"b2\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv style=\"color:#999;font-size:10.5px;margin-top:4px\" id=\"ptotal\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"box\">\u003ch3>Sponsors\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"in ads\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"ad\">Your Ad Here\u003cbr>125 × 125\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"ad\">Your Ad Here\u003cbr>125 × 125\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"box\">\u003ch3>Stay Updated\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"in\">\n          \u003ca href=\"#\" class=\"glossy\" style=\"display:block;text-align:center\">📡 Subscribe RSS Feed\u003c/a>\n          \u003cp style=\"font-size:10.5px;color:#8894a5;margin-top:8px;text-align:center\">Get the latest posts in your RSS reader!\u003c/p>\n        \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cfooter>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"links\">\u003ca href=\"#\">Home\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">About\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Contact\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Privacy\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Site Map\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv>© 2006–2007 PixelPortal.com · All rights reserved · \u003cspan class=\"badge\">XHTML 1.0\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"badge\">CSS\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"badge rss\">RSS ▸\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/footer>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // live-ish date in breadcrumb\n    document.querySelector('.breadcrumb').innerHTML = 'Today is \u003cb>' + new Date().toDateString() + '\u003c/b> — You are here: \u003ca href=\"#\">Home\u003c/a> » \u003ca href=\"#\">Articles\u003c/a> » \u003cb>Web design is dead (again)\u003c/b>';\n\n    // poll with animated result bars\n    const votes = [214, 87, 31];\n    document.getElementById('pvote').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const pick = +document.querySelector('input[name=\"p\"]:checked').value;\n      votes[pick]++;\n      const total = votes.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\n      document.getElementById('pollOpts').style.display = 'none';\n      document.getElementById('pvote').style.display = 'none';\n      document.getElementById('pollRes').style.display = 'block';\n      votes.forEach((v, i) => {\n        const pct = Math.round(v / total * 100);\n        document.getElementById('p' + i).textContent = pct + '%';\n        setTimeout(() => document.getElementById('b' + i).style.width = pct + '%', 60 * i + 50);\n      });\n      document.getElementById('ptotal').textContent = 'Total votes: ' + total + ' — thank you for voting!';\n    });\n\n    // comment posting\n    document.getElementById('cpost').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const name = document.getElementById('cname').value.trim() || 'Anonymous 2006';\n      const text = document.getElementById('ctext').value.trim();\n      if (!text) { document.getElementById('ctext').focus(); return; }\n      const div = document.createElement('div');\n      div.className = 'comment';\n      const now = new Date();\n      div.innerHTML = '\u003cdiv class=\"ava\">🙂\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"who\">' + name.replace(/\u003c/g, '&lt;') +\n        ' \u003cspan>· just now\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cp>' + text.replace(/\u003c/g, '&lt;') + '\u003c/p>\u003c/div>';\n      const list = document.getElementById('clist');\n      list.insertBefore(div, list.firstChild);\n      document.getElementById('ctext').value = '';\n      document.getElementById('cname').value = '';\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}